sequenceDiagram
  actor dev as Equipe
  participant gh as GitHub Actions
  participant vm as VM corredor-ubs
  participant sd as systemd
  dev->>gh: git tag v1.0-demo
  gh->>vm: copia a release para /opt/corredor/releases
  vm->>sd: troca o link current e reinicia
  gh->>vm: smoke test GET /api/radar
  alt resposta 200
    vm-->>gh: ok, versão no ar
  else falhou
    gh->>vm: rollback: link volta para a anterior
    vm->>sd: reinicia corredor-api
  end
